  "tip": "<p>When you see requirements that stress <i>serverless</i> and <i>unpredictable spikes</i>, favor fully managed building blocks that decouple stages such as Cloud Storage events, Pub/Sub fan out, a scalable processing engine like Dataflow, and managed AI APIs. Be wary of answers that add VM management or reference <i>deprecated</i> tools.</p>",
